{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23374","headline":"和微之诗二十三首 和晨霞 · 白居易","name":"和微之诗二十三首 和晨霞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君歌仙氏真，我歌慈氏真。\n慈氏发真念，念此阎浮人。\n左命大迦叶，右召桓提因。\n千万化菩萨，百亿诸鬼神。\n上自非相顶，下及风水轮。\n胎卵湿化类，蠢蠢难具陈。\n弘愿在救㧞，大悲忘辛勤。\n无论善不善，岂间冤与亲。\n抉开生盲眼，摆去烦恼尘。\n烛以智慧日，洒之甘露津。\n千界一时度，万法无与邻。\n借问晨霞子，何如朝玉宸。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23374.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23374","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}